{
  "case_id": "2008-06-1249",
  "document_hash": "84e28f2b128fdfbafb254b499afc0616a14a1f93ab0e8747fbb145ff90cccfff",
  "records": [
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2008-06-1249",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "84e28f2b128fdfbafb254b499afc0616a14a1f93ab0e8747fbb145ff90cccfff",
      "evidence_id": "ev-84e28f2b128f-0000-0003",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 1,
        "start": 1
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Monday, November 3, 2008 The above-entitled matter came on for oral argument before the Supreme Court of the United States at 10:06 a.m."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Seth P. Waxman",
      "case_id": "2008-06-1249",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "84e28f2b128fdfbafb254b499afc0616a14a1f93ab0e8747fbb145ff90cccfff",
      "evidence_id": "ev-84e28f2b128f-0000-0000",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 3,
        "start": 3
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "This case concerns conflict pre-emption under the Supremacy Clause, and the conflict presented here is stark."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Seth P. Waxman",
      "case_id": "2008-06-1249",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "84e28f2b128fdfbafb254b499afc0616a14a1f93ab0e8747fbb145ff90cccfff",
      "evidence_id": "ev-84e28f2b128f-0000-0004",
      "kind": "fact",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 3,
        "start": 3
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Repeatedly over the years, the FDA approved Phenergan injection as safe and effective under all the conditions and methods of use described in the labeling, including what is referred to as \"IV push\" injection."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
      "case_id": "2008-06-1249",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "84e28f2b128fdfbafb254b499afc0616a14a1f93ab0e8747fbb145ff90cccfff",
      "evidence_id": "ev-84e28f2b128f-0001-0001",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 19,
        "start": 19
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE BREYER: Why isn't -- why isn't the fact that some certain number of people are getting gangrene, why isn't that new information?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "FDA",
      "case_id": "2008-06-1249",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "84e28f2b128fdfbafb254b499afc0616a14a1f93ab0e8747fbb145ff90cccfff",
      "evidence_id": "ev-84e28f2b128f-0001-0002",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 20,
        "start": 20
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "New information means new information about a risk that is greater in severity or frequency."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Amicus Dr. Budhwani et al.",
      "case_id": "2008-06-1249",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "84e28f2b128fdfbafb254b499afc0616a14a1f93ab0e8747fbb145ff90cccfff",
      "evidence_id": "ev-84e28f2b128f-0001-0003",
      "kind": "amicus_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 28,
        "start": 28
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "as the amicus brief by Dr. Budhwani, et al. at pages 54 establishes had Wyeth been a reasonably prudent manufacturer over the years, it would have known that the risks of IV push so far outweigh any bearing negligible benefits, that it would have offered a stronger instruction, it would have moved to revise its label either with FDA approval or --"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Frederick",
      "case_id": "2008-06-1249",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "84e28f2b128fdfbafb254b499afc0616a14a1f93ab0e8747fbb145ff90cccfff",
      "evidence_id": "ev-84e28f2b128f-0002-0000",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 37,
        "start": 37
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Our position is that the duty is on the manufacturer to make a safe label, and if the label is --"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Souter",
      "case_id": "2008-06-1249",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "84e28f2b128fdfbafb254b499afc0616a14a1f93ab0e8747fbb145ff90cccfff",
      "evidence_id": "ev-84e28f2b128f-0002-0001",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 38,
        "start": 38
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Is that a fair statement of your position?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Frederick",
      "case_id": "2008-06-1249",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "84e28f2b128fdfbafb254b499afc0616a14a1f93ab0e8747fbb145ff90cccfff",
      "evidence_id": "ev-84e28f2b128f-0002-0002",
      "kind": "fact",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 39,
        "start": 39
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "And if the label is not adequate for public safety it is a misbranded drug."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Waxman",
      "case_id": "2008-06-1249",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "84e28f2b128fdfbafb254b499afc0616a14a1f93ab0e8747fbb145ff90cccfff",
      "evidence_id": "ev-84e28f2b128f-0002-0004",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 53,
        "start": 53
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Summary judgment was decided at the -- pre-emption was decided at summary judgment before trial."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Source extraction",
      "case_id": "2008-06-1249",
      "confidence": 0.0,
